			]
			description: [
				"The &lPyrolyse Oven&r is an electric &6Coke Oven&r with a LOT more products. This is one way to work towards &7ethylene&r."
				""
				"&cWARNING&r: If you are going to use an &7LV&r energy hatch, then you will need 2 for them to overclock to &bMV&r!"
