				"With a bunch of &bMV&r stuff and steel, you can make a &lFluid Drilling Rig&r. This machine can drill various fluids from under bedrock, including oil and natural gas."
				""
				"Oil marks the beginning of &opetrochemistry&r, and right now you can turn it into various fuels or turn it into ethylene."
