		{
			dependencies: ["6AE7BABF9BF1417D"]
			description: [
				"Unlike &baluminium&r in &7LV&r, you will not need to set up a lot of infrastructure to create the material of the next voltage: &lStainless Steel&r to make &6HV&r machinery. You just need to make the dust in an &bMV&r mixer and send it off to an &aEBF&r overclocked to &6HV&r &o(so, with 2 &bMV&r&o energy hatches)&r. And that's it!"
